// Hostile Zero-Trust Test Suite: Python-Replacement Stdlibs, AI Harness Optimization & Security Hardening
// (`tests/pass/54_python_stdlib_and_ai_harness_hostile.ax`)
// Covers 100% pure-Axon `secrets`, `json_dom`, `regex`, `glob`, `shutil`, `difflib`, `subprocess`,
// `fetch`, `tiktoken`, `ai_harness`, `ai_agent`, `ai_eval`, `agent_toolkit`, `mcp`, `ffi`, `net`, `path`, `crypto`.

use std::ffi
